**

!.dockerignore
!docker/
!docker/linux-build/
!docker/linux-build/**

# Dependency manifests and local xmake package recipes are the only project
# files needed while pre-warming the build image.
!xmake.lua
!xmake/
!xmake/**
!thirdparty/
!thirdparty/**
!submodules/
!submodules/xmake.lua
!submodules/minirtc/
!submodules/minirtc/xmake.lua
!submodules/minirtc/thirdparty/
!submodules/minirtc/thirdparty/**
